{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10644050","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10644050","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1064405001:0":{"text":" 吹雪の中、残されたわずかな兵士たちは、背中を預け合い荒い息を吐いていた。魔物の群れに包囲されながら、誰ひとり武器を下ろす者はいなかった。","source_cn":"风雪中，所剩无几的士兵背靠背，呼吸沉重，魔物已将他们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x688625D9E000C616","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1064405002:0":{"text":"ハァ……ハァ……ライメル、左だ！","source_cn":"呼……呼……莱默尔，左边——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x387FC17CED4F2E00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1064405003:0":{"text":"魔物の鋭い爪がライメルの腕を貫く。すかさずロセがそれを切り落とす。魔物は苦痛の咆哮を上げるも、再びライメルに襲いかかった。","source_cn":"一只魔物利爪贯穿莱默尔的手臂，罗塞挥剑将其斩断，前者发...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50B752BAF67596CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1064405004:0":{"text":"だめだ……俺は退くわけにはいかない！","source_cn":"不……我不能后退！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2297DAE6BAB8CBA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064405005:0":{"text":"死闘の果てに二人の剣は砕けかけ、もはや逃げ場すら残されていなかった。魔物がとどめの一撃を放とうとした瞬間……","source_cn":"当士兵们的武器卷刃、绽出裂纹，魔物准备发出致命一击时……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4610B8B3788DC05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","d