":""},"say:26:1064405016:0":{"text":"生き残った兵士たちも、ひび割れた盾を掲げ、折れた槍を手に、アルナの背を追って魔物に突撃した。","source_cn":"残存士兵重整队列，裂盾并作盾墙，断矛前指，追随阿尔娜的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5463A2C207BBEEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1064405017:0":{"text":"アルナ将軍のために！サバス城のために！突撃だぁーーっ！","source_cn":"为了阿尔娜将军！为了安息城！冲啊——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA14AD8CACEB5E95C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1064405018:0":{"text":"うぉぉ！戦うぞーーっ！","source_cn":"战斗！战斗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1C5101EE580D0AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1064405019:0":{"text":"カタストロフ総帥を失った魔物の大軍は、アルナと兵士たちの猛攻を受け、完全に崩れ去った。","source_cn":"失去了恶魔统领，在阿尔娜与剩余士兵的打击下，魔物大军彻...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96BE3BB2CB8982B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1064405020:0":{"text":"魔物が……本当に退いていく……サバス城は守られたんだ！","source_cn":"魔物……魔物真的被打退了！安息城守住了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D70F6B246DDBA71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1064405021:0":{"text":"アルナ将軍！将軍のおかげで俺たちは……あれ？さっきまでそこに……","source_cn":"阿尔娜将军！是